    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DION \u2013 A Survival Game Inspired by West African Empires</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>DION</strong>, a multiplayer survival game that transports you to the heart of a brutal world inspired by the great West African empires. Here, only your ingenuity and strength will determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Persistent and Ruthless World</strong><br>Explore rich and diverse landscapes, from arid savannas to lush jungles. Every resource matters, and every encounter could be an opportunity\u2026 or a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f <strong>Build, Craft, Survive</strong><br>Manage your base, craft your own tools and weapons, and hunt to ensure your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight or Cooperate</strong><br>In <strong>DION</strong>, diplomacy is just as powerful as the sword. Form alliances, betray your enemies, and dominate the wild lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/cf129e31fa903d83122ce66c1920231a.poster.avif?t=1753644292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/cf129e31fa903d83122ce66c1920231a.webm?t=1753644292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/cf129e31fa903d83122ce66c1920231a.mp4?t=1753644292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Unleash Your Power: Transform!</strong><br>Master the ancient art of shapeshifting and take on the form of mythical or wild animals. Whether hunting your enemies, escaping imminent danger, or harnessing unique abilities, transformation is a formidable weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/1b219cd5f1373fca7099f617cac32200.poster.avif?t=1753644292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/1b219cd5f1373fca7099f617cac32200.webm?t=1753644292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/1b219cd5f1373fca7099f617cac32200.mp4?t=1753644292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A Rich Lore Inspired by History</strong><br>Discover a fascinating universe inspired by 13th-century West African civilizations, where legends and traditions intertwine with survival and conquest.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DION \u2013 A Survival Game Inspired by West African Empires</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <strong>DION</strong>, a multiplayer survival game that transports you to the heart of a brutal world inspired by the great West African empires. Here, only your ingenuity and strength will determine your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>A Persistent and Ruthless World</strong><br>Explore rich and diverse landscapes, from arid savannas to lush jungles. Every resource matters, and every encounter could be an opportunity\u2026 or a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f <strong>Build, Craft, Survive</strong><br>Manage your base, craft your own tools and weapons, and hunt to ensure your survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight or Cooperate</strong><br>In <strong>DION</strong>, diplomacy is just as powerful as the sword. Form alliances, betray your enemies, and dominate the wild lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/cf129e31fa903d83122ce66c1920231a.poster.avif?t=1753644292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/cf129e31fa903d83122ce66c1920231a.webm?t=1753644292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/cf129e31fa903d83122ce66c1920231a.mp4?t=1753644292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e <strong>Unleash Your Power: Transform!</strong><br>Master the ancient art of shapeshifting and take on the form of mythical or wild animals. Whether hunting your enemies, escaping imminent danger, or harnessing unique abilities, transformation is a formidable weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/1b219cd5f1373fca7099f617cac32200.poster.avif?t=1753644292\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/1b219cd5f1373fca7099f617cac32200.webm?t=1753644292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563860/extras/1b219cd5f1373fca7099f617cac32200.mp4?t=1753644292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>A Rich Lore Inspired by History</strong><br>Discover a fascinating universe inspired by 13th-century West African civilizations, where legends and traditions intertwine with survival and conquest.</p>",
